Hi all,

I have a question regarding msPGOcc models. I am trying to
fit a model on spider data: 78 species distributed in 50 plots, each visited 5
times.

I have some data on species-specific functional traits which
would be relevant to add to the model, e.g. the hunting strategies of each
species, which impacts their trapping rate.

I haven’t found documentation on species specific traits in
msPGOcc, and the few tries I made have failed. I am now looking to confirm that
this feature indeed does not exist in spOccupancy? And, do you have any
alternative strategies which you could recommend?

Thanks a lot in advance :)

Jeanne

